{"id":"118f704d7c920f6a","group":"62","path":"62/62-thm-FiveSystems.md","title":"Big Five Interval Consequence","display":"thm-FiveSystems — Big Five Interval Consequence","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-thm-FiveSystems","aliases":["62-thm-FiveSystems"],"display":"thm-FiveSystems — Big Five Interval Consequence","depends_on":["[[62-thm-SubsystemInclusion]]","[[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), §I.1; Remarks I.10.2, I.11.4 (chain consequence)","source_pages":[1,36,40],"source_pdf_pages":[19,54,58]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-thm-FiveSystems"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-thm-FiveSystems</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-FiveSystems — Big Five Interval Consequence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f313c6ed0d590fe2\" href=\"?note=f313c6ed0d590fe2\" title=\"62-thm-SubsystemInclusion\">62-thm-SubsystemInclusion</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"781620ab41bfeebd\" href=\"?note=781620ab41bfeebd\" title=\"62-df-equivalence-over-base\">62-df-equivalence-over-base</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), §I.1; Remarks I.10.2, I.11.4 (chain consequence)"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>1</span><span>36</span><span>40</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>19</span><span>54</span><span>58</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>严格链及理论接口见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f313c6ed0d590fe2\" href=\"?note=f313c6ed0d590fe2\" title=\"62-thm-SubsystemInclusion\">62-thm-SubsystemInclusion</a>，Cn 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"781620ab41bfeebd\" href=\"?note=781620ab41bfeebd\" title=\"62-df-equivalence-over-base\">62-df-equivalence-over-base</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B=\\{\\mathrm{RCA}_0,\\mathrm{WKL}_0,\\mathrm{ACA}_0,\\mathrm{ATR}_0,\\Pi^1_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{CA}_0\\}\">\\(\\mathcal B=\\{\\mathrm{RCA}_0,\\mathrm{WKL}_0,\\mathrm{ACA}_0,\\mathrm{ATR}_0,\\Pi^1_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{CA}_0\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}FiveSystems}\\vdash\\;\\forall T\\in\\mathcal B\\quad\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{RCA}_0)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(T)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(\\Pi^1_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{CA}_0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}FiveSystems}\\vdash\\;\\forall T\\in\\mathcal B\\quad\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{RCA}_0)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(T)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(\\Pi^1_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{CA}_0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是严格链的区间推论，保留原节点的可形式化内容。书中 Big Five 是大量数学反演结果的组织框架，不是“每一个数学定理恰好等价于这五个系统之一”的全称分类定理。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），§I.1; Remarks I.10.2, I.11.4 (chain consequence)；纸面页 1, 36, 40；PDF 页 19, 54, 58。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-thm-SubsystemInclusion","status":"resolved","id":"f313c6ed0d590fe2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-thm-SubsystemInclusion]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-equivalence-over-base","status":"resolved","id":"781620ab41bfeebd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-thm-SubsystemInclusion","status":"resolved","id":"f313c6ed0d590fe2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"严格链及理论接口见 [[62-thm-SubsystemInclusion]]，Cn 见 [[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]。$\\mathcal B=\\{\\mathrm{RCA}_0,\\mathrm{WKL}_0,\\mathrm{ACA}_0,\\mathrm{ATR}_0,\\Pi^1_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{CA}_0\\}$。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-equivalence-over-base","status":"resolved","id":"781620ab41bfeebd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"严格链及理论接口见 [[62-thm-SubsystemInclusion]]，Cn 见 [[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]。$\\mathcal B=\\{\\mathrm{RCA}_0,\\mathrm{WKL}_0,\\mathrm{ACA}_0,\\mathrm{ATR}_0,\\Pi^1_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{CA}_0\\}$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal B=\\{\\mathrm{RCA}_0,\\mathrm{WKL}_0,\\mathrm{ACA}_0,\\mathrm{ATR}_0,\\Pi^1_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{CA}_0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}FiveSystems}\\vdash\\;\\forall T\\in\\mathcal B\\quad\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{RCA}_0)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(T)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Cn}_{S_2}(\\Pi^1_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{CA}_0).","display":true}],"bytes":1356,"backlinks":[{"id":"c68a6ecbed6addff","anchor":"ref-96","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[62-thm-FiveSystems|Big Five Interval Consequence]]"}],"outgoing":["f313c6ed0d590fe2","781620ab41bfeebd"]}